{'symbol': 'BLL', 'date': '2022-02-03 11:00:00', 'title': 'BALL CORPORATION AND ANHEUSER-BUSCH TO BRING INFINITELY RECYCLABLE ALUMINUM CUPS TO FANS AT THE BIG GAME FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'WESTMINSTER, COLO., FEB. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BALL CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: BLL) AND ANHEUSER-BUSCH\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP TO BRING THE INFINITELY RECYCLABLE BALL ALUMINUM CUP™ TO GUESTS AT SOFI STADIUM IN LOS ANGELES FOR THE BIG GAME ON FEBRUARY 13, 2022.'}